OL,3,GNEWSA'Olympic success doesn't help on  
OL,4,Athe dancefloor'                        
OL,6,FWinter Olympic gold medallist and      
OL,7,FStrictly Come Dancing star Tabby       
OL,8,FStoecker has said her sporting success 
OL,9,Fdid not guarantee she would be a good  
OL,10,Fdancer.                                
OL,12,FThe bobsleigh athlete, who trains at   
OL,13,Fthe University of Bath, finished at the
OL,14,Ftop of the leaderboard with her        
OL,15,Fprofessional dance partner Mark        
OL,16,FKarmalita during week nine of the BBC's
OL,17,Fflagship show.                         
OL,19,F"Being an Olympian does not give me an 
OL,20,Fedge at all. I've never danced before,"
OL,21,Fshe said.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
