OL,3,GNEWSA'Olympic success doesn't help on  
OL,4,Athe dancefloor'                        
OL,6,F"I will say my personality and my      
OL,7,Fmindset around training and wanting to 
OL,8,Fimprove is definitely something I'm    
OL,9,Frelying on. You need to be really      
OL,10,Fdetermined to learn and grow, so I do  
OL,11,Fthink in that regard I'm happy that    
OL,12,FI've got an elite athlete background." 
